{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019eFHtJFCPr31ZX8nYwanPs","type":"tool_result","content":"967-### Where these two numbers come back\n968-\n969:[Omitted long matching line]\n970-\n971-Two numbers in a Pod spec; four later chapters. It's worth getting right the first time.\n--\n1025-[Omitted long context line]\n1026-\n1027:This item required §5 and §8 together, which is the point: it's the direct precursor to Chapter 13's material on diagnosing killed and evicted Pods. What we're **not** doing here is diagnosing it. Naming the mechanism is this chapter's job. Which command to run and which events to read is Chapter 13's *[cross-bearing: see Ch 13 §4 — OOMKilled and Evicted]*.\n1028-\n1029----"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a146facc-be90-4e53-94d0-c9b5b5169c8e","uuid":"18d23a5b-89bf-4ffc-9d56-de45f7639177","timestamp":"2026-08-31T07:51:57.915Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"967-### Where these two numbers come back\n968-\n969:[Omitted long matching line]\n970-\n971-Two numbers in a Pod spec; four later chapters. It's worth getting right the first time.\n--\n1025-[Omitted long context line]\n1026-\n1027:This item required §5 and §8 together, which is the point: it's the direct precursor to Chapter 13's material on diagnosing killed and evicted Pods. What we're **not** doing here is diagnosing it. Naming the mechanism is this chapter's job. Which command to run and which events to read is Chapter 13's *[cross-bearing: see Ch 13 §4 — OOMKilled and Evicted]*.\n1028-\n1029----","numLines":11,"totalLines":11}}
